@startuml
' newpage splits the diagram so each page fits landscape A4: PlantUML exports
' seq-parcel-history-receipt.png, seq-parcel-history-receipt_001.png, ... (one file per page).
title Sequence Diagram - Delivery History, Details and Receipt (1 of 4)
caption SwiftDrop parcel-service (Role 3)

hide footbox
autonumber
skinparam dpi 200
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam maxMessageSize 110
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam BoxPadding 6
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor black
  LifeLineBorderColor #555555
  ParticipantBorderColor black
  ParticipantBackgroundColor white
  ActorBorderColor black
  ActorBackgroundColor white
  BoxBorderColor black
  BoxBackgroundColor #F2F2F2
  GroupBorderColor black
  GroupBackgroundColor #E8E8E8
  DividerBorderColor black
  DividerBackgroundColor #E8E8E8
}
skinparam database {
  BorderColor black
  BackgroundColor white
}
skinparam note {
  BorderColor black
  BackgroundColor white
}

actor Customer
actor "Visitor\n(no login)" as V
participant "React SPA /\ntracking page" as FE
participant "API Gateway\n:8080" as GW
box "parcel-service :8083" #F2F2F2
  participant "CustomerParcel\nController" as CTRL
  participant "PublicTracking\nController" as PCTRL
  participant "ParcelService" as SVC
  participant "PdfReceipt\nService" as PDF
end box
database "parcel_db" as DB

== 1. My deliveries (delivery history) ==
Customer -> FE : open "My deliveries"
FE -> GW : GET /api/v1/parcels\n?status&page&size&sort\n(Bearer JWT)
GW -> CTRL : forward (JWT checked\nwith auth-service JWKS)
CTRL -> CTRL : verify JWT again;\ncheck page, size, sort
alt missing / invalid token
  GW --> FE : 401 Unauthorized
else page < 0, size < 1, or unknown sort field
  CTRL --> FE : 400 ProblemDetail (via GW)
end
CTRL -> SVC : listParcels(caller,\nstatus, page)
alt caller is DISPATCHER or ADMIN
  SVC -> DB : SELECT all parcels\n(optional status filter)
else any other caller
  SVC -> DB : SELECT parcels WHERE\ncustomer_id = caller
end
SVC --> FE : 200 {content, page, size, totalElements}\n(via CTRL, GW)
FE --> Customer : list of my parcels
note over CTRL, DB
  Newest first by default (sort=createdAt,desc). Page size is capped
  at 100. List rows have no status history; it comes with the details.
end note

newpage Sequence Diagram - Delivery History, Details and Receipt (2 of 4)
== 2. Parcel details ==
Customer -> FE : open one parcel
FE -> GW : GET /api/v1/parcels/{id}\n(Bearer JWT)
GW -> CTRL : forward (JWT checked)
CTRL -> SVC : getParcelForCustomer(\nid, caller)
SVC -> DB : SELECT parcel and its\nstatus history
alt no such parcel, or it belongs to another customer\n(and the caller is not DISPATCHER / ADMIN)
  SVC --> FE : 404 Not Found (via CTRL, GW)
else owner, DISPATCHER or ADMIN
  SVC --> FE : 200 {trackingNo, status, addresses, recipient,\nsize, weightKg, fee, failureReason,\nhistory[status, who, role, note, proof, time]}\n(via CTRL, GW)
  FE --> Customer : details and status timeline
end
note over SVC, DB
  The same 404 is used for "does not exist" and "not yours",
  so nobody can find out which parcel IDs exist.
end note

newpage Sequence Diagram - Delivery History, Details and Receipt (3 of 4)
== 3. Download the receipt (PDF) ==
Customer -> FE : Download receipt
FE -> GW : GET /api/v1/parcels/{id}/receipt\n(Bearer JWT)
GW -> CTRL : forward (JWT checked)
CTRL -> SVC : getReceiptPdf(id, caller)
SVC -> DB : SELECT parcel
alt no such parcel, or not the owner (same rule as the details)
  SVC --> FE : 404 Not Found (via CTRL, GW)
end
SVC -> PDF : generateReceipt(parcel)
PDF -> PDF : build the PDF (OpenPDF):\ntracking number, booking date (UTC),\nstatus, addresses, recipient name,\nmasked recipient phone, size, weight,\nfee breakdown and total (LKR),\nlink to the tracking page
PDF --> SVC : PDF bytes
SVC --> FE : 200 application/pdf\nContent-Disposition: inline;\nfilename="receipt-{id}.pdf"\n(via CTRL, GW)
FE --> Customer : open or save the receipt
note over SVC, DB
  Built from the saved parcel: the fee breakdown stored at booking
  is shown, so the receipt stays the same even if the pricing rules
  change later (architecture section 8).
end note

newpage Sequence Diagram - Delivery History, Details and Receipt (4 of 4)
== 4. Public lookup by tracking number (no login) ==
V -> FE : enter SD-7K3Q-9P2M
FE -> GW : GET /api/v1/track/\nSD-7K3Q-9P2M\n(no JWT, public route)
GW -> PCTRL : forward
PCTRL -> PCTRL : trim, upper-case,\ncheck SD-XXXX-XXXX
alt malformed tracking number
  PCTRL --> FE : 400 Bad Request (via GW)
end
PCTRL -> SVC : getPublicTracking(\ntrackingNo)
SVC -> DB : SELECT parcel and history\nby tracking_no
alt unknown tracking number
  SVC --> FE : 404 Not Found (via PCTRL, GW)
end
SVC --> FE : 200 {trackingNo, status, size, weightKg,\ncreatedAt, history[status, time]}\n(via PCTRL, GW)
FE --> V : current status and timeline
note over PCTRL, DB
  Public data only: no internal IDs, names, phone numbers,
  addresses, notes or failure reasons. For live updates the page
  opens /track/{trackingNo}/stream (see seq-live-tracking).
end note

@enduml
